{"seq":2,"slug":"hard-soft-light","title":"硬光与柔光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/hard-soft-light","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"硬光与柔光\">硬光与柔光</h1><p>正午阳光在人脸上切出刀锋般的阴影边缘，阴天却让同一张脸的明暗过渡像被橡皮擦抹开——这两种截然不同的「光的脾气」，摄影里叫硬光和柔光。它们不是亮度问题（一盏柔光箱可以很亮），而是阴影边缘的清晰程度问题。掌握软硬，比掌握任何一种「网红布光法」都更根本，因为软硬决定了画面的情绪基调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光的软硬只取决于一个变量：<strong>光源相对被摄体的视张角</strong>。同一盏灯，离得越近、面积越大，张角越大，光越柔；离得越远、面积越小，张角越小，光越硬。太阳直径 139 万公里却仍是硬光，正因为 1.5 亿公里的距离把它压成了天空中一个约 0.5° 的小点。</p>\n<p>阴影边缘的过渡区叫<strong>半影</strong>（penumbra）。当光源是一个有面积的圆盘时，被摄物边缘投下的阴影不再是一刀切的本影，而是从全暗渐变到全亮的一圈半影。半影宽度近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>penumbra</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>obj-shadow</mtext></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>light-obj</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{penumbra}} \\approx s \\cdot \\frac{d_{\\text{obj-shadow}}}{d_{\\text{light-obj}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penumbra</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">light-obj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obj-shadow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是光源直径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>light-obj</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{light-obj}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">light-obj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是光源到物体的距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>obj-shadow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{obj-shadow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obj-shadow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是物体到阴影面的距离。可见：光源越大、越近，半影越宽，光越柔。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[光源] --&gt; B{视张角大小}&#10;    B --&gt;|张角大&lt;br/&gt;大且近| C[半影宽&lt;br/&gt;柔光]&#10;    B --&gt;|张角小&lt;br/&gt;小或远| D[半影窄&lt;br/&gt;硬光]&#10;    C --&gt; E[阴影边缘渐变&lt;br/&gt;情绪柔和 · 显年轻]&#10;    D --&gt; F[阴影边缘锐利&lt;br/&gt;戏剧 · 强调质感]\">flowchart TD\n    A[光源] --&gt; B{视张角大小}\n    B --&gt;|张角大&lt;br/&gt;大且近| C[半影宽&lt;br/&gt;柔光]\n    B --&gt;|张角小&lt;br/&gt;小或远| D[半影窄&lt;br/&gt;硬光]\n    C --&gt; E[阴影边缘渐变&lt;br/&gt;情绪柔和 · 显年轻]\n    D --&gt; F[阴影边缘锐利&lt;br/&gt;戏剧 · 强调质感]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>硬光</th>\n<th>柔光</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光源视张角</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影边缘</td>\n<td>锐利、清晰</td>\n<td>渐变、模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高光</td>\n<td>镜面小亮点、对比强</td>\n<td>大面积、过渡平缓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>皮肤质感</td>\n<td>放大毛孔、皱纹</td>\n<td>弱化瑕疵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型来源</td>\n<td>裸灯、聚光灯、晴日太阳</td>\n<td>柔光箱、阴天、白墙反射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见用途</td>\n<td>男性硬汉、产品质感、戏剧</td>\n<td>美妆、人像、商业柔美</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决定软硬的三个旋钮\">决定软硬的三个旋钮</h2><p>很多人以为「加个柔光箱就是柔光」，其实柔光箱挂得太远照样是硬光。真正控制软硬的是三个可调旋钮：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>光源物理面积</strong>：换更大的柔光箱、反光伞，或让灯打向更大的反射面（如白墙、天花板）。</li>\n<li><strong>光源到主体的距离</strong>：同一柔光箱拉近一倍，视张角约翻倍，立刻柔很多。这是最快、最免费的调节办法。</li>\n<li><strong>扩散层数</strong>：在光源前加柔光布、双层扩散，把硬边缘进一步打散。代价是损失光量（往往 1–2 档）和衰减加快。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这里有一条容易混淆的因果链需要厘清：拉近光源既让光变柔，又让照度上升、衰减变陡——后者属于<a href=\"intensity-inverse-square\">光强与平方反比定律</a>的范畴。两件事同时发生，但物理机制不同：软硬看张角，亮度看距离平方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"半影几何的实拍直觉\">半影几何的实拍直觉</h2><p>把上面的公式翻译成棚里的手感：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同样一盏 90cm 柔光箱</strong>，贴到模特 0.5 米处，张角巨大，阴影几乎无边界——柔到极致；拉到 4 米处，张角缩小到太阳级别，又变回硬光。</li>\n<li><strong>手掌挡阳光的小实验</strong>：手离桌面近，影子边缘锐利；手抬高远离桌面，影子边缘发虚。这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>obj-shadow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{obj-shadow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obj-shadow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增大让半影变宽的日常版。</li>\n<li><strong>逆推光源大小</strong>：看一张人像照，若鼻翼阴影边缘干净利落，说明用的是小而远的光源；若过渡如雾，说明光源又大又近。读片时这是判断布光的第一线索。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[想要的质感] --&gt; B{柔还是硬}&#10;    B --&gt;|柔 / 显嫩 / 商业美| C[大光源 + 贴近 + 加扩散]&#10;    B --&gt;|硬 / 戏剧 / 强质感| D[小光源 + 拉远 + 裸灯或聚光]&#10;    C --&gt; E[配合柔光箱 · 反光伞]&#10;    D --&gt; F[配合蜂巢 · 雷达罩 · 标准罩]\">graph TD\n    A[想要的质感] --&gt; B{柔还是硬}\n    B --&gt;|柔 / 显嫩 / 商业美| C[大光源 + 贴近 + 加扩散]\n    B --&gt;|硬 / 戏剧 / 强质感| D[小光源 + 拉远 + 裸灯或聚光]\n    C --&gt; E[配合柔光箱 · 反光伞]\n    D --&gt; F[配合蜂巢 · 雷达罩 · 标准罩]</pre><p>具体用哪种附件实现「大而近」或「小而硬」，是器材层的话题，详见<a href=\"../lighting-gear/softbox-modifiers\">柔光箱与改光附件</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软硬如何服务于内容\">软硬如何服务于内容</h2><p>软硬不是越柔越好，而是要匹配拍摄意图：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>人像美颜方向</strong>：柔光弱化皮肤瑕疵、缩小明暗反差，让肤色均匀，是商业人像、美妆广告的主流。</li>\n<li><strong>性格与戏剧方向</strong>：硬光放大皱纹、肌理与轮廓，适合表现沧桑、力量、阳刚，黑色电影（film noir）即大量用硬光制造阴影戏剧性。</li>\n<li><strong>产品质感方向</strong>：金属、皮革等需要清晰的高光与质感时用硬光；磨砂、化妆品等需要均匀过渡时用柔光。具体配光见<a href=\"../scenarios/product-still-life\">产品与静物布光</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>混合策略</strong>：实战常是「柔光做主光 + 硬光做发际/轮廓光」，用硬光勾边把主体从背景剥离，用柔光铺脸。轮廓光的角色在<a href=\"../lighting-setups/three-point-portrait\">人像三点布光</a>展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>「柔光箱越大越柔」只在距离不变时成立</strong>：一个 60cm 箱贴脸，可能比 120cm 箱拉远三米更柔。决定性的是张角，不是绝对尺寸。</li>\n<li><strong>「柔光 = 没有方向」是错的</strong>：柔光仍有明确方向和阴影，只是边缘软。无方向的「死平光」是把光打散到四面八方（如大面积顶部漫射），那已不是软硬问题而是布光结构问题。</li>\n<li><strong>加扩散布一定更柔？</strong> 只有当扩散布让有效发光面变大时才更柔。若布紧贴小灯头，发光面仍小，柔化有限，主要只是损光。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光的软硬由光源相对被摄体的<strong>视张角</strong>决定，与亮度无关。</li>\n<li>阴影半影宽度随光源直径、贴近程度增大而变宽——这是柔的物理本质。</li>\n<li>三个调节旋钮：光源面积、光源距离、扩散层数；其中「拉近」最快也最免费。</li>\n<li>软硬要服务内容：柔光显嫩，硬光显质感与戏剧，实战常软硬混用。</li>\n<li>别把绝对尺寸当软硬标准——张角才是；别把「柔」误解为「无方向」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"硬光与柔光","id":"硬光与柔光"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"决定软硬的三个旋钮","id":"决定软硬的三个旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"半影几何的实拍直觉","id":"半影几何的实拍直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"软硬如何服务于内容","id":"软硬如何服务于内容"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"光强与平方反比定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/intensity-inverse-square"},"next":{"title":"色温与显色性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/color-temperature-cri"}}